
       RESET-BOARD SECTION.
           PERFORM VARYING GRID-Y-COUNTER FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL 
           GRID-Y-COUNTER > 6
               PERFORM VARYING GRID-X-COUNTER FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL 
               GRID-X-COUNTER > 7
                   MOVE ' ' TO GRID-CELL(GRID-X-COUNTER GRID-Y-COUNTER)
               END-PERFORM
           END-PERFORM
       .
